"The deserters are mortal soldiers of the Alliance's eastern levy who ran after the Empire fell."
"Their leader, Corrin, is a hard man with a spear; the other two would rather go home."
"A small mana spring rises in a fern hollow two miles in; herbs there are worth gold apiece."
"The mana boar beds down near the mana spring and guards it without knowing why."
"Sitting an hour by the mana spring counts as gathering in the wilds, thick with mana."
